Palmy for the same input or a similar one.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:52.040
In Rio Negro, papers said an amputation prosthesis had been delivered.

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:54.320
An official report said that was false.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:59.600
The mother's signature on the delivery note the report says was obtained by inducing error

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:02.700
when measurements were taken, not by handing over the device.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:10.880
On the 8th of July 2025, Pharma Salud was paid 425 million pesos for a bicarvel transcatheter

